Package: sparky-pjeoffice-codec
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Private FFmpeg 5.1 decoder libraries for PJeOffice Pro's video cutter
 PJeOffice Pro's cutter plays video through JavaFX Media, which looks for
 FFmpeg libraries of the major versions 53 to 59 (libavcodec up to 59). The
 system's FFmpeg is newer, so nothing could be loaded and the cutter showed a
 generic error. These libraries are FFmpeg 5.1.10, unmodified, built as shared
 libraries with only the decoders, demuxers and parsers of the formats JavaFX
 Media plays (H.264 and AAC in MP4, FLV with VP6, MP3, WAV, AIFF), and kept in
 /usr/lib/sparky-pjeoffice/codec. Only the PJeOffice Pro launcher puts that
 folder on a library path, and only for that program; the system's FFmpeg is
 not replaced.
